# nexus
===
 An all-mode amateur radio operations center — FT8/FT4, CW (with an AI decoder), SSB phone, RTTY, SSTV, APRS and satellites in one modern app: native decode, waterfall, spots, live propagation map, POTA/SOTA & Field Day, and a DXCC logbook with LoTW/QRZ/ClubLog/eQSL. Rust + Tauri; GPLv3.
